# Multi-tree / forecasting experiment artifacts (branch is-multitree).
# All regenerable, and too large to track: fetch_trees.py and fetch_snapshots.py
# re-download the builds, generate_all.py and make_forecast_testset.py rebuild the
# example files byte-identically, and checkpoints are ~224 MB each.
nextstrain/
runs/
tree_pulled_*.json
experiments/multitree/data/**/*.txt
# Analysis intermediates from the s14 scripts (rank_agreement, gate_search,
# fuse_*, seed_curve, zeroshot_eval). Every one is reproduced by rerunning its
# script; the numbers that matter are transcribed into NOTES.md, and the only
# arrays the figure needs are in antiGen-figures/data/multitree/.
experiments/multitree/out/
# The Bundibugyo build zeroshot_eval.py scores, pulled from Nextstrain like the
# rest of the trees above.
recent.json
